#new:String $PurpleToad1
{
[Style Left]
You see my arm? It's a bionic arm. [BR]
[Pause 5]I crushed my arm beneath my dresser[BR]
a while back and [Wave]maaaan[/fx] did it hurt.[BR]
[Wait][Next]
The doc said I could either keep my[BR]
flaccid weiner arm[Pause 3] or get a bionic arm. [BR]
[Pause 5]I couldn't say no to the alternative. [BR]
[Pause 8][PrintRising]Now I'm jacked.[/fx][BR]
[Wait][Next]
[Shake][Size 24]Hrrrraaaghhhh![BR]
[Wait][End]
}

#new:String $PurpleToad2
{
[Style Left]
Not only did I crush my arm beneath[BR]
my dresser, but I also crushed my[BR]
balls beneath the cutting board.[BR]
[Pause 15]Don't ask how I did that.[BR]
[Wait][Next]
So now I can't have kids and I have[BR]
to jack off with a bionic arm.[BR]
[Pause 10]I am severely handicapped.[BR]
Maybe I can apply for disability.[BR]
[Wait][End]
}

#new:String $PurpleToad3
{
[Style Left]
I've learned all there is to know[BR]
about having a bionic arm.[BR]
[Pause 10]I'm a bionic commando now. [DitherFade percent=80]Heh.[/fx][BR]
[Wait][Next]
Any of those punks who come my[BR]
way in the Love's Ladder challenge[BR]
will have a heaping of knuckle[BR]
sandwich in their faces.[BR]
[Wait][Next]
Trust me, it ain't painless.[BR]
[Pause 12]In fact,[Pause 4] I've smacked myself in the[BR]
face a few times just trying to control[BR]
this blasted thing.[BR]
[Wait][End]
}

#new:String $NotDoneTattle
{
[Style Tattle]
[EnableCDownNext]
He says that not all of the[BR]
Love Hotel is finished yet.[BR]
[Pause 10]Wait... if that's the case...[BR]
[Wait][Next]
...then how are all those[BR]
other contestants going to[BR]
[SaveColor][Color:09]Love's Ladder[RestoreColor], huh?[BR]
[Wait][Next]
[PrintRising][Shake]Grrrr![/fx][BR]
Dang beta testers.[BR]
Always getting stuff early.[/fx][BR]
[Wait][Next]
[PrintRising]It's no fair.[/fx][BR]
[Pause 5]Whatever.[Pause 5] Guess we'll have[BR]
to wait, Mario.
[Wait][End]
}

